#: page.missedcall.php:51
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A missed call notification feature that alerts the user when a call has been "
"made to their device / extension but was not answered. This feature "
"typically sends an alert to the user via email, indicating that a call was "
"missed and providing the caller's phone number or contact information. This "
"feature is designed to help users quickly and easily return calls they may "
"have missed."
msgstr ""
"未接來電通知功能，當撥叫至使用者的裝置 / 分機但未接通時，會向使用者發出警示。此功能通常透過電子郵件向使用者傳送警示，表示有未接來電，並提供撥叫者的電話號碼或聯絡資訊。此設計旨在協助使用者快速輕鬆地回撥可能漏接的來電。"

